<title>HONG KONG: TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Hong Kong Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-4 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>4-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Jim Grabb (U.S.) 6-1  6-2</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) beat Neville Godwin (South Africa) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>5-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Carsten Arriens (Germany) 4-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>Sebastien Lareau (Canada) beat 8-Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 6-1 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Brian MacPhie (U.S.) beat 2-Marc Rosset (Switzerland)  7-6 (7-2) 6-2</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>Johansson beat Gimelstob 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Rafter beat 3-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) 6-3 6-1.</p>
</text>
